        "q_what_if_it_does_not_suit_me": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if it does not suit me?",
            "answer": "<p>Give it two weeks. If it is still not right, we will swap it for a different skin type or refund you, whichever you prefer, any time up to 60 days after your order arrives. Return postage is on us, and you send back whatever is left in the bottle.</p> <p>Sometimes we will refund you and tell you to keep it. One claim per product, per customer, and the full terms are in the <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">refund policy</a>.</p>",
            "set_piece": "none",
            "ethos_icon": "none",
            "ethos_label": ""
          }
        },
        "q_what_does_delivery_cost_and_how_quickly_will": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does delivery cost, and how quickly will it arrive?",
            "answer": "<p>Standard delivery is £5.99, and free on orders over £40. Express is £7.99, free over £80. If your postcode starts EX22, EX23 or EX39, orders over £20 come free and we bring them to you ourselves.</p><p>Everything is made by hand in small batches. If what you have ordered is in stock, we dispatch within one to two working days. If it is not, we make it for you and dispatch within five working days. From dispatch, Royal Mail delivers Standard in three to five days and Express in one to three. We deliver across the UK and nowhere else for now, and the full details are in our <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">delivery policy</a>.</p>",
            "set_piece": "delivery_pair",
            "ethos_icon": "none",
            "ethos_label": ""
          }
        },
        "q_why_aluminium": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why aluminium?",
            "answer": "<p>It can be recycled again and again without losing quality, and recycling it takes around 5% of the energy needed to make it new. The pump is bamboo and plastic, and is made to be reused.</p>",
            "set_piece": "none",
            "ethos_icon": "ethos-climate",
            "ethos_label": "Recyclable aluminium bottles, reusable pump"
          }
        },
        "q_do_you_sell_anywhere_other_than_online": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you sell anywhere other than online?",
            "answer": "<p>Not yet. We are talking to a handful of independent shops in north Devon. If you run one and would like to stock us, <a href=\"mailto:store@biotaderm.com\">email us</a>.</p>",
            "set_piece": "none",
            "ethos_icon": "none",
            "ethos_label": ""
